<para id="RM000002U5100GX" category="J" type-id="302L1" name-id="066OR-00" from="200708">
<dtccode/>
<dtcname>Fuel injector circuit</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM000002U5100GX_03" type-id="32" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___0000EV200000">
<name>Wiring Diagram</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A177932J01" width="7.106578999in" height="5.787629434in"/>
</figure>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000002U5100GX_01" type-id="51" category="05" proc-id="RM0550J___0000GVA00000">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<ptxt>The following shows the inspection procedure for cylinder No.1. If a malfunction occurs in a cylinder other than cylinder No.1, refer to the following procedure and inspect the circuit of the relevant cylinder.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000002U5100GX_02" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM000002U5100GX_02_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___0000EUX00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Wire Harness and Connector (Power Source System)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<atten4>
<ptxt>For the wire harness and connector inspection procedure and precautions, see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000005D702RX"/>.</ptxt>
</atten4>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A105992J07" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<test1>
<ptxt>Disconnect the fuel injector assembly connector.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn IG ON.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the voltage between the terminals.</ptxt>
</test1>
<spec>
<title>Voltage</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.48in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="0.83in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="0.82in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>2 (+B) - Engine ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>IG ON</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>11 to 14 V</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<test1>
<ptxt>Turn IG OFF.</ptxt>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000002U5100GX_02_0002" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM000002U5100GX_02_0004" fin="false">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000002U5100GX_02_0002" proc-id="RM0550J___0000EUY00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Fuel Injector Assembly</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<ptxt>For fuel injector assembly inspection, refer to <xref label="Seep01" href="RM000002AAX004X"/>.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000002U5100GX_02_0003" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM000002U5100GX_02_0006" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000002U5100GX_02_0003" proc-id="RM0550J___0000EUZ00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Wire Harness and Connector (Fuel Injector Assembly - Engine Control Computer)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<ptxt>For the wire harness and connector inspection procedure and precautions, see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000005D702RX"/>.</ptxt>
</atten4>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A177933J01" width="7.106578999in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
<test1>
<ptxt>Disconnect connector A of the engine control computer.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the terminals. (see <xref label="Seep02" href="X39400000QV01SD"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="4.25in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.42in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.41in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection (Terminal Symbol)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A45 (#10) - Terminal 1</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="4.25in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.42in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.41in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection (Terminal Symbol)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A45 (#10) and terminal 1 - Other terminals and body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>10 kΩ or higher</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Terminal 2 - Other terminals and body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>10 kΩ or higher</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000002U5100GX_02_0010" fin="true">OK</down>
<right ref="RM000002U5100GX_02_0007" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000002U5100GX_02_0004" proc-id="RM0550J___0000EV000000">
<testtitle>Inspect Fuse (IG2 Fuse)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Remove the IG2 fuse from the engine room R/B.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A177934J01" width="2.775699831in" height="2.775699831in"/>
</figure>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the terminals.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.37in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>IG2 Fuse</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000002U5100GX_02_0005" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="RM000002U5100GX_02_0008" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000002U5100GX_02_0005" proc-id="RM0550J___0000EV100000">
<testtitle>Inspect Integration Relay (IG2 Relay)</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<atten4>
<ptxt>For the wire harness and connector inspection procedure and precautions, see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM0000005D702RX"/></ptxt>
</atten4>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Install the IG2 fuse.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Remove the integration relay from the engine room R/B.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the terminals.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="A154432J03" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.03in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.07in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.03in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A1 - B4</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Battery voltage applied between C2 and C3</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000002U5100GX_02_0007" fin="true">OK</down>
<right ref="RM000002U5100GX_02_0009" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000002U5100GX_02_0006">
<testtitle>Replace Fuel Injector Assembly<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000002AAY004X"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000002U5100GX_02_0007">
<testtitle>Repair or Replace Wire Harness or Connector</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000002U5100GX_02_0008">
<testtitle>Replace Fuse (IG2)</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000002U5100GX_02_0009">
<testtitle>Replace Integration Relay</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000002U5100GX_02_0010">
<testtitle>Replace Engine Control Computer<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000002ADB004X"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
</subpara>
</para>
